WEBVTT

00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:02.100
<i>White gossamers.</i>

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.740
<i>They're mysterious creatures 
that live in the underworld.</i>

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:09.100
<i>They're cryptids that sometimes
spotted in the human world as well.</i>

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:12.790
<i>Even in the underworld, they're one 
of the fluffiest creatures,</i>

00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:14.940
<i>and everyone is familiar with them.</i>

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:18.040
<i>Just like cats and bunnies 
in the human world,</i>

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.030
<i>they find themselves represented 
in all sorts of collectibles.</i>

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.590
<i>No one knows how these creatures function,</i>

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:28.580
<i>and sometimes, when an unfortunate 
soul looks into its eyes,</i>

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:31.370
<i>they're pulled into a shadowy abyss...</i>

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.220
<i>Well, not really. Nothing like that happens.</i>

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:36.600
<i>They're balls of fluff that 
are completely harmless.</i>

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:42.890
Your Highness, let's take a short break.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:45.850
That looks good.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.340
You're always so cute.

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:07.560
Speaking of which, white gossamers are 
really popular right now.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.810
Did you know that?

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:10.590
No, not really.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:14.100
There's a café that did a joint promotion 
with one of the white gossamer shows.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.490
Oh, that's pretty cool.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:22.950
I'd like to check it out sometime...

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.210
I don't see a problem with that.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.100
At least once you finish your work.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.910
It's Sargatanas-oneesama!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.040
Look at how serious she looks!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.370
She looks so wonderful!

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.500
Completely collected.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:19.840
And then there's that rumor that she takes 
care of all the real work in Finance.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.340
I wish I could be like her.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.490
Oneesama, hold me!

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.760
Hey, we never said you could do that!

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:31.440
<b>I Want to Say "Cute."</b>

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:34.430
Good morning.

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:35.910
Good morning.

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:38.280
Good morning, Sargatanas-sama.

00:03:40.810 --> 00:03:43.610
Oh, is that a <i>Fluffy Whiskers 
& Friends</i> pouch?

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:45.950
<i>Fluffy Whiskers & Friends?!</i>

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:52.780
<i></i>Fluffy Whiskers & Friends<i> is currently 
the biggest thing in the underworld.</i>

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:56.480
<i>It's about a white gossamer, Fluffy 
Whiskers, and his merry friends</i>

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:58.880
<i>who live in White Gossamer Valley.</i>

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.480
<i>It's extremely popular with 
younger grade school girls,</i>

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:04.470
<i>adult women, and everything in 
between—any girl that loves cute.</i>

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:08.180
<i>They just can't get enough of 
those "whiskers" and purple ears.</i>

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.510
Pretty cool, right?

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:11.390
You can only get it at the 
café they partnered with.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.640
Wow, that's so cute.

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.530
I want one, too!

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:16.540
You...

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.200
Oh, sorry about that! Good morning!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.460
Good morning!

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.360
Oh, this is from <i>Fluff Friends</i>.

00:04:22.840 --> 00:04:25.490
Do you know about <i>Fluffy Whiskers & Friends</i>?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.780
It's about a white gossamer.

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.180
I see...

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:30.470
<i>I love it!</i>

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:31.870
<i>So fluffy!</i>

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:36.030
I guess you wouldn't be 
interested, Sargatanas-sama.

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:38.040
Sorry, I'm into all this childish stuff.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.320
It's fine.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:40.890
<i>But I love it!</i>

00:04:40.890 --> 00:04:43.260
<i>Fluffy!</i>

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.600
They're too cute!

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.350
<i>I want to go to the Fluffy Whiskers Cafe.</i>

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:55.310
<b>So good</b>

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:55.310
<i>I want to meet Fluffy Whiskers.</i>

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.270
<i>But...</i>

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:00.400
<i>I'm not sure if I can just 
show up to some place so cute,</i>

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.360
<i>with all these cute people and things, 
when I'm the furthest from that.</i>

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:09.150
<i>I think I'd stand out and 
ruin the mood for everyone else.</i>

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:11.330
<i>Fluffy Whiskers...</i>

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:14.370
<i>No, I'm going to go.</i>

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.600
<i>I want to go to the 
Fluffy Whiskers Cafe, too.</i>

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:20.340
<i>All I have to do is make sure 
I don't stand out in any way.</i>

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:27.840
<b>Weekend</b>

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.510
There's already a line, even 
though the café isn't open yet.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:35.640
But I'm sure we'll be able to 
get in right away when it opens.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:36.920
Yeah.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:37.980
What?

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.780
What's up with this girl?

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:40.940
Definitely something strange going on.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.360
She's pretty sexy, though.

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.280
Curves

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:44.280
<b>& Butt</b>

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:45.800
Wait, but she's flat up top?

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:46.740
Flat...

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.270
<i>This doesn't make sense...</i>

00:05:48.270 --> 00:05:50.660
<i>I feel like even more people 
are looking at me than usual.</i>

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:54.210
<i>I made sure to put on clothes that 
wouldn't attract any suspicion...</i>

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:56.270
<i>No, I'm being too self-conscious.</i>

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:57.500
<i>I need to keep it together.</i>

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.070
<b>Worried</b>

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.080
I better stay away from her.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:01.740
Are you by yourself today?

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:03.570
Oh, uh, yes.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:05.920
I'll take your order before you enter.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:13.350
I guess she's a cute lady, after all.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.810
<b>Walking in</b>

00:06:15.930 --> 00:06:19.160
<i>I knew there'd be a lot of girls 
and couples coming here together.</i>

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:22.740
<i>Being into Fluffy Whiskers makes 
more sense for them than me.</i>

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.320
This is your table.

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:27.760
<i>I feel bad for taking up a 
full table all by myself.</i>

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.090
We'll be placing someone at your table.

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.280
Huh? What does that mean?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.170
<i>Fluffy!</i>

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:37.080
<i>A service of kindness.</i>

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.150
Please enjoy your time here.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.710
<i>This is great.</i>

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.280
<i>This joint partnership thing 
is better than I imagined.</i>

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.820
<i>Oh, hold on.</i>

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.880
<i>I can't let people see me 
enjoying myself like this.</i>

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:53.680
That's Azazel...

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:56.640
Sargatanas?

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:00.590
<b>Silence...</b>

00:06:58.300 --> 00:07:00.600
<i>And now they're sitting 
together, for some reason.</i>

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:04.030
<i>Why is Azazel here?</i>

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:06.100
<i>And why is he all dressed up?</i>

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:07.870
I don't know what to say to him.

00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:10.070
Here you are!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:11.910
So cute!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.190
Fluffy-chan is so cute! Super cute!

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:14.480
They did such a good job at 
creating the characters!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:19.230
Everything's so cute! 
So cute, I can't eat them!

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:21.490
Am I in heaven?

00:07:16.390 --> 00:07:21.490
Did I go to heaven?!

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.790
I didn't think you'd be into Fluffy Whiskers...

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:29.550
I didn't think you would, either.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:33.150
I've always liked cute things.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.360
I just want to gobble them up.

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.770
I just can't help myself.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.220
<i>I understand.</i>

00:07:39.570 --> 00:07:43.260
It's just, you know, how I'm perceived 
and how I actually am don't match up...

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:44.740
When people find out,

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.730
many of them can't handle it, 
so I try to hide it instead.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.190
<i>I understand exactly!</i>

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:53.080
I resolved myself to come today,

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.990
and I even came here dressed completely 
in black so I wouldn't stand out at all.

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:59.200
<i>I thought she just liked dressing like that.</i>

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:04.540
I just didn't think I should 
come to a place like this.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.240
That's not true at all!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:13.830
I used to think something similar before.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.830
Well, I guess I still really do, but...

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:17.290
But I think the people here want us to be happy.

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:22.130
That's why they come out with new items.

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:25.090
That's why they have this café.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:30.060
And I don't want to be rude to Fluffy, and so when I buy anything Fluffy-related, I'm careful to keep Fluffy's reputation positive.

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:34.310
That's why I dress up nicer and carry myself better, to the best of my ability.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:37.070
That's far more important than being embarrassed.

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:38.530
I see.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:40.470
That's why you're dressed so nice.

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:46.600
I came here trying not to stand out, 
thinking that was helping Fluffy...

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.880
But I think I was just 
being selfish, after all.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:54.410
Your nails are done the same primary color as Fluffy, right? Purple...

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.760
I didn't really think about that...

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.010
I just did it to help me work up the courage.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.960
I'm sure Fluffy is glad you did that.

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:08.360
I'm glad I worked up the 
courage to come today.

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:11.440
Thank you, Azazel.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:13.890
I didn't do a thing.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.830
We're here, Mullin.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:24.330
It's the Fluffy Whiskers Café.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.840
Yeah... I'm glad we made it.

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.920
<i>I knew it in the back of my head,</i>

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:32.050
<i>but I don't fit in at all!
It's way too fancy here!</i>

00:09:32.390 --> 00:09:33.740
So excited.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:36.660
<i>I didn't expect her to finish handling 
all those documents so quickly...</i>

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:35.090
So excited.

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:37.010
So excited.

00:09:37.130 --> 00:09:38.460
Please come this way.

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:42.930
It's really cute in the café, too.

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.610
<i>I'm just on an inspection. 
I'm just doing an inspection here.</i>

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:52.110
<i>It's part of my job, as an assistant, to make 
sure I know what's popular in the underworld.</i>

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.320
What's that?!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.110
Welcome!

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:02.210
Oh, you silly Astaroth-sama!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.410
Fluffy! Fluffy!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.190
Huh?

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:10.140
This is really fun, Mullin.

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:12.130
There's so much fluffy.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.060
I love Fluffy-tan!

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:15.670
<i>She bought all the merchandise.</i>

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.210
<i>This is my job.</i>

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:18.540
<i>Part of my job to go on inspections.</i>

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:19.570
<i>I have to do this for Her Highness.</i>

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.550
<i>Don't think of anything!</i>

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:21.640
<i>Meditate!</i>

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:28.720
The last summer season had 
some really great Fluffy stuffy.

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:25.470
They had a melon motif going on!

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:29.080
The green they used with the 
Spring picnic design was great!

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:31.850
I know, right?!

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:31.360
What's going on?

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.890
I thank you, Fluffy.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:51.710
Adult
& Cute

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.330
That's a cute swimsuit!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.150
The beach is great.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:53.950
I haven't gone at all.

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:55.640
Really?

00:10:55.640 --> 00:10:58.550
Yeah, I only went once when I was a kid.

00:10:58.550 --> 00:11:01.430
You should go more often.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:04.870
There's a lot of men at the beach.

00:11:04.870 --> 00:11:08.020
Though you wouldn't have to diet before 
the trip, so you wouldn't have a problem.

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:08.010
<b>Tee-hee...</b>

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:11.860
Oh, yeah, I think there's 
a Pandemonium-managed

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:15.240
recreational facility with a private beach...

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:16.580
Want to try it out?

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.990
I'd love to go with you, Bell!

00:11:19.730 --> 00:11:23.450
I've really wanted to go to the beach!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.760
Then, let's check which days we can go.

00:11:26.760 --> 00:11:29.370
Yeah, this'll be great!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:32.090
Isn't that great, Belphegor-sama?!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:37.420
<b>Let's Go to the Beach.</b>

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:39.470
You want to know what days you have off?

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:43.260
Yes, I want to go to the beach with Gocchin.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:46.350
Oh, that'll be fun.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:48.350
I'll look over your schedule.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.600
Oh, there's one day you have free here.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.900
That's great.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.010
Yeah.

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:56.200
<i>Wait, hold on a second.</i>

00:11:57.050 --> 00:11:58.840
<i>If two girls head to the beach by themselves,</i>

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.910
<i>all these drunks looking for a good 
time are going to try to hit on them!</i>

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:05.260
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:05.260
<b>No!</b>

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:05.260
<b>No!</b>

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:05.020
<i>I don't want the banana! I want a dolphin!</i>

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:08.370
<i>Then someone might try to see them 
changing, or just generally perv on them!</i>

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:09.950
<i>Maybe I should go with them...</i>

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:12.880
<i>No, I can't just invite myself...</i>

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:16.800
<i>But I am Her Highness's assistant, 
so I should protect her...</i>

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:20.920
<i>But if a bunch of guys did try to 
hit on her, could I even handle it?!</i>

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:23.930
<i>What should I do?!</i>

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.050
Mullin and Azazel will be coming with us.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:29.630
Oh, no!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.910
I-I-I-I can't do that! I can't! I can't!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.640
I can't go to the beach with Azazel-sama!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.750
How much are you going to say you can't?

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.130
You're okay with that, Bell?

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.380
You'll be going to the beach 
with Mullin-kun, you know?!

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.050
Huh? Yeah.

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.960
We'll be going to the beach—

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:47.270
Actually, I'm glad to be able 
to spend my day off with Mullin.

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:48.990
So that's how you're thinking...

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.640
You're not happy, Gocchin?

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:54.380
You get to go to the beach with Azazel-sama!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:58.210
<i>I-I'm happy...</i>

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:03.260
<i>I've not been to the beach since my part-time 
bed and breakfast job during high school.</i>

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.550
<i>Did I bring my swimsuit 
with me from my parent's?</i>

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:07.920
<i>I know it's half-work, 
and that's why I'm going,</i>

00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:10.860
<i>but I get to go to the beach with 
some cute girls on my day off.</i>

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:13.920
<i>I'm glad I got a job here at Pandemonium.</i>

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:15.560
<i>I'm just being silly.</i>

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.110
Bro!

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:23.320
I want to get ripped this instant! 
How do I do that?!

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:26.760
<i>I guess you do act your age sometimes.</i>

00:13:26.760 --> 00:13:28.840
<i>A six-pack of excitement.</i>

00:13:29.710 --> 00:13:34.250
Hey, Bell... Wh-What should 
I do about my swimsuit?

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.030
I don't have any.

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:38.920
Just go and buy one at a 
shop somewhere when we go.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:40.540
Seriously?!

00:13:40.540 --> 00:13:41.880
Is that a problem?

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:46.350
Well, I'd like a better selection, I guess...

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:53.010
<i>If I'm going with Azazel-sama, then I want 
to get something he'd think was cute...</i>

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.390
<i>Not that I have the self-confidence 
necessary to wear a swimsuit in front of him.</i>

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:58.600
<i>This'll probably happen.</i>

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:58.600
<b>Wraps
herself
